  "description": "<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-698efa5e-3908-8397-af10-72fb3ac87537-7\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-80\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"8965c954-5811-41e5-83fc-e3bc3f7438f0\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"308\">De HP EliteBook 855 G7 is een zakelijke laptop die is ontworpen voor professioneel en betrouwbaar dagelijks gebruik. Dankzij de AMD Ryzen 5 Pro-processor en het ruime werkgeheugen is deze laptop zeer geschikt voor multitasking, kantoorwerk en thuisgebruik.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"564\"><strong data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"351\">Wat is het product, waarvoor geschikt</strong><br data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"354\">Deze laptop is geschikt voor gebruikers die een stabiele en snelle machine zoeken voor werk, studie en administratieve taken. Ideaal voor zakelijke toepassingen, videobellen, tekstverwerking en internetgebruik.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"798\"><strong data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"595\">Korte productbeschrijving</strong><br data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"598\">De EliteBook 855 G7 combineert degelijke prestaties met een professioneel ontwerp. Het systeem werkt soepel onder Windows 11 en biedt een prettige gebruikerservaring voor dagelijks productief gebruik.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"803\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"814\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"833\"><strong data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"833\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"855\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"1011\">\r\n<li data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"902\">\r\n<p data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"902\">⭐ AMD Ryzen 5 Pro voor stabiele prestaties</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<p data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"941\">⭐ 16GB RAM voor soepel multitasken</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"976\">\r\n<p data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"976\">⭐ Zakelijk en duurzaam ontwerp</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1011\">\r\n<p data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1011\">⭐ Geschikt voor werk en studie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1016\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1038\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1051\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1051\">Merk: HP</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1079\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1079\">Model: EliteBook 855 G7</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1110\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1110\">Processor: AMD Ryzen 5 Pro</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1137\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1137\">Werkgeheugen: 16GB RAM</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1159\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1159\">Opslag: 256GB SSD</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1193\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1193\">Besturingssysteem: Windows 11</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1219\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1224\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1244\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1275\">HP EliteBook 855 G7 laptop</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1287\">Oplader</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1316\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1351\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 6 maanden garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
